The class walked `NodeList`s with the same index-loop + `ELEMENT_NODE` filter in three methods. I extracted the shared intent:
```java
private static void forEachElement(NodeList nodeList, Consumer<Node> consumer) {
    for (int i = 0; i < nodeList.getLength(); i++) {
        Node node = nodeList.item(i);
        if (node.getNodeType() == Node.ELEMENT_NODE) {
            consumer.accept(node);
